This project is an independent macOS implementation for SayoDevice hardware.
It references public SayoDevice documentation and the Sayobot Sayo_CLI project
for protocol interoperability research. No Sayobot source code or runtime
dependency is included in this repository.

Upstream references:

* Sayobot Sayo_CLI: https://github.com/Sayobot/Sayo_CLI
* SayoDevice manual: https://github.com/Sayobot/SayoDevice_manual

Those upstream projects retain their own licenses and notices. Consult the
upstream repositories before redistributing any of their material.
